                        ),
                      ),
                    ],
                  ),
                ),
                if (_plannedDuration.inHours >= 4)
                  Container(
                    padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(
                        horizontal: 10, vertical: 4),
                    decoration: BoxDecoration(
                      color: Colors.red,
                      borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(8),
                    ),
                    child: const Text(
                      'غياب طويل',
                      style: TextStyle(
                          color: Colors.white,
                          fontSize: 12,
                          fontWeight: FontWeight.bold),
                    ),
                  ),
              ],
